<title>SOUTH AFRICA: South African policeman robbed cabinet ministers.</title>
<headline>South African policeman robbed cabinet ministers.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South African policeman who guarded the homes of cabinet ministers has been suspended after being found with luxury items stolen from six of them.</p>
<p>A police spokeswoman said on Thursday the officer was accused last month of taking the items, including a gold watch belonging to Finance Minister Trevor Manuel.</p>
